| File | Role |
| ---- | ---- |
| `apps/portal/app/catalog/[tourId]/register/public-catalog-registration-flow.tsx` | Step machine |
| `apps/portal/app/api/public-auth/*` | BFF → `apps/api` `/public/auth/*` |
| `apps/api/src/identity/public-auth.routes.ts` | verify + register-complete |
| `apps/api/src/identity/otp.service.ts` | dev static `1234` |

